| Test Suite | File | Tests | Status |
|------------|------|-------|--------|
| NavChart Types | `chart_types_test.go` | 4 | ✅ Pass |
| Normalizer Pipeline | `normalizer_test.go` | 13 | ✅ Pass |
| Chart Store | `chart_store_test.go` | 19 | ✅ Pass |
